---
/* Entreno tab, above the Entrenamiento dashboard section (Entrenos.astro): the detail behind
 * Inicio's load dial (Whoop keeps the glance on Home and the detail one tap away), then the running
 * and cycling tables and load vs recovery. Hosts only — all client-rendered from globals baked by
 * <Bake> (hosted by Registro.astro):
 *   #score-load    per-modality load cards + caveats (client/score.js, SCORES)
 *   #health-train  running, cycling, load vs recovery (client/health.js, HEALTH)
 * `jump-anchor` gives #score-load the same scroll margin as a section (the load dial jumps here).
 */
---
<div id="score-load" class="jump-anchor"></div>
<div id="health-train"></div>
